    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000ttis](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000ttis) Magnitude 5.4 earthquake at 10.0 depth occurred on Oct 27 2026 71km N of Baqên. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 32.5388 longitude 93.9028. It impacted 12372 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
